  message: "Fixed in PR #2309 (merged to dev, eaa18ee23). Every exit path flushes stdout and stderr, points a broken one at /dev/null and exits 141. Live repro on dev eaa18ee23, outputs in ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr6/live_repro/ lubig.txt: hypergumbo sketch packages/hypergumbo-tracker with both streams / stderr only / stdout only into head -c 10 -> 141 / 141 / 141 (before: 120 / 120 / 141); hypergumbo --help into a pre-closed stdout -> 141 (before 120 + traceback); sketch --no-such-flag into a pre-closed stderr -> 141 (before 120). 36-form sweep: pr6/lubig/RESULTS.md. Residual: WI-rulub."  # 1814
